# -------------------------------------------------------------------- smith
# temp:10 the answer, temp:11 which box is showing, temp:12 whether
# something has been said yet, temp:13 where in the shop menu he is,
# temp:30 to temp:37 repair prices and the hero's gold.

[message 100]
Well, look who it is. What can I do for you?

  ~Buy and sell~
  ~Look over unknown items~
  ~Mend equipment~

                   ~Leave~

[message 101]
  ~Weapon         %9d gold~
  ~Helmet         %9d gold~
  ~Body armor     %9d gold~
  ~Shield         %9d gold~
  ~Boots          %9d gold~
  ~All you wear   %9d gold~
  ~All in the bag %9d gold~
                       ~Back~

[message 102]
You can't pay for that.

[message 103]
Nothing there needs mending.

[message 104]
Telling what those are will cost you %d gold.

             ~Go ahead~  ~Never mind~

[message 105]
You've nothing on you I can't put a name to.

[message 106]
The goblins have gotten bolder lately, and there are
kinds out there I've never laid eyes on.
Nobody comes to buy anymore. I'm going broke!

[message 107]
Leave me be. I'm in no mood for talk.

[message 108]
Wait, is it true? You killed that red brute on the
north-east road? Well! You're nothing like the
cowards they sent before.

.......

[message 109]
I've misjudged you, friend!

[message 110]
I'm the smith here, and I trade a bit besides.
Whatever you need, come to me. I'll treat you fair.

[message 111]
Since we're friends now, a favor. A goblin chief down in
the far south-west of town robbed me of a gem.
Could you bring it back?

[message 112]
Is that it? My gem! You got it back?

[message 113]
.......

[message 114]
It is! Thank you, truly. Let me tell you something
in return that might be worth your while.

[message 115]
Out in the depths of the Wasteland of Pillars, an odd fellow
keeps a shop. He traded here once, until the town threw him
out for cheating.

Drop in on him if you pass. I'll send him word about you.

[message 116]
They say you drove the goblins out of the ruins.
I knew you had it in you!

[message 117]
And now you're off to Cold Svalt, I hear.
I'd hoped you would stay.

[message 118]
My brother keeps a shop over there. I'll let him know
you're coming, so go and say hello. And take this with you.

[message 119]
You've come for the old knight's order?

[message 120]
.......

[message 121]
It's no great matter, but do get it to him.

[message 122]
Nothing I make round here is good enough for you anymore.

[message 123]
Still, you'll need potions. From now on,
I'll stock those for you.

