[message 49]
Pip
~See how I'm doing~
~Tell me about yourself~
~Swap partners~
~Leave~

[message 50]
So you tracked me down at last.

[message 51]
Mind you, I was hoping for a lady to look after me.

[sentence pip]
on=talk pip
C_STOP pip
C_SETANGLETO pip 0
SETFLAG temp:40 0
TALK msg:49 temp:41 1 3 -1 -1

[sentence pip-end]
on=talk-end pip
IF temp:40 = 2 @pip-done
IF temp:40 = 1 @pip-more
IF temp:40 = 0 @pip-choice

[sentence pip-done]
