# Near the Remote Town. The red goblin chief (monster 0) is the healer's
# first errand: beating it clears mission 0.
#
# The road south to the Caravan and the second area, as the original's:
# it opens once Cold Svalt Town's commander has sent the hero on to the
# mining town (save:71 set), and until then walking into it does nothing.

object=18385,26522,19296,26999,caravan-road

[sentence chief-down]
on=enemy-dead 14000000
SETQUESTFLAG 0 2 1

[sentence caravan-road]
on=judge caravan-road
IF save:71 ! 0 @to-caravan

[sentence to-caravan]
CHANGESCENARIO 12999999 0
