# ---- The soldier from the south (save:12: 1 met, 2 praised the hero) -------

[message 134]
I'm from the south, so this cold cuts right through me.
I'm heading home the moment this mission is over.

[message 135]
Have you met the merchant here?
His brother keeps a shop in Remote Town.

[message 136]
Hey, good work! You cleared the monsters
out of those ruins, didn't you?

[message 137]
Look after yourself. The commander here
works his soldiers to the bone.

[message 138]
The soldiers have been trading an odd rumor lately:
"When the snow stops falling, a gargoyle comes."

[message 139]
Come to think of it, it hasn't snowed in days.

