# ---- The boy who wants to be a knight (save:14) ----------------------------

[message 142]
Hey, you're new around here, aren't you?

[message 143]
I'm going to be a knight one day!

[message 144]
The old man up in the north of town used to be a knight.
Imagine being a knight. That would be the best!

[message 145]
The lady over there is so sad.
Could you cheer her up?

[message 146]
She's smiling again.
Thank you so much!

