# ---- The widow: her keepsake ruby (save:15, quest:4) -----------------------

[message 147]
Who are you?

[message 148]
Are you one of the new hired swords?

[message 149]
The man I was going to marry died in the last attack.
I don't know what to do with myself anymore...

[message 150]
They say the ice beast that prowls northwest of town
killed him. The ruby he always carried was gone from
his body. It was a keepsake the two of us shared.

[message 151]
Could you find that ruby and bring it back to me?
Please, whatever it takes.

[message 152]
Please, bring the ruby back to me.

[message 153]
That's it... that's our ruby! Thank you, thank you.
Now he can finally rest.

[message 154]
Please take this as my thanks for finding it.
I'm truly grateful.

[message 155]
Thank you again for bringing the ruby home.

