# ---- The old knight: his errand (save:16, quest:5) -------------------------
# He asks only once the hero is past level 15; he takes the Scarlet Dirk
# (weapon 90000010) from Remote Town's merchant and gives his old sword
# (weapon 90000011).

[message 156]
Ah, you must be the new hired sword! I've been waiting.
Sit down and hear my tale!

[message 157]
In my younger days I was a knight, and I cut down
monsters by the dozen!

[message 158]
The soldiers today are soft next to me!
How can a few goblins take them so long?

[message 159]
Now then...
Hey, where are you off to?

[message 160]
Come back for the rest of my tale?
...Wait, where are you going?

[message 161]
There you are.
...No, hold on a moment. This one matters.

[message 162]
You look like a warrior with a future.
I have a favor to ask.

[message 163]
I ordered something from the merchant in Remote Town,
but with the monsters about, it never came.

[message 164]
You're strong; fetch it for me. I'm too old for the road.
If this body still moved the way it used to,
I'd go myself.

[message 165]
I'm counting on you!

[message 166]
Ah, you brought it, just as you promised.
What a fine young warrior you are.

[message 167]
Here, this blade served me in my youth. It's a good one,
and with your skill you'll handle it well.

