# ---- The merchant, brother of Remote Town's (save:18) ----------------------
# Trade (list 2 of shops.txt), identify for 100 gold, or repair, as in the
# original. temp:17 says which box is showing: 0 the menu, 1 the repair
# list, 2 too little gold to repair, 3 nothing to repair (both back to the
# repair list), 4 the identify question, 5 too little gold to identify,
# 6 nothing to identify. temp:6-12 hold the repair prices (hand, head,
# body, shield, legs, all worn, the bag).

[message 171]
Care to trade? Or I can repair or appraise your things.
~Trade~
~Identify items~
~Repair items~
~Leave~

[message 172]
~Weapon             %9d gold~
~Head               %9d gold~
~Body               %9d gold~
~Shield             %9d gold~
~Legs               %9d gold~
~Everything worn    %9d gold~
~Everything carried %9d gold~
~Leave~

[message 173]
Looks like you're short of gold.

[message 174]
That one doesn't need any work.

[message 175]
Appraising costs %d gold. All right?
~Yes~  ~No~

[message 176]
You have nothing that needs appraising.

[message 177]
I keep a shop here in town.

[message 178]
My brother wrote to me about you. You've slain a good
many monsters, haven't you? Glad to meet you.

