# ---- The healer: heals for nothing (save:19) -------------------------------

[message 179]
I tend the hurt and the weary here,
with the help of the holy spirits.

[message 180]
Come to me whenever you're wounded or worn out.

[message 181]
...And it costs nothing.

[message 182]
Holy spirits, wash these wounds away!

[message 183]
You look well enough to me.

[sentence healer]
on=talk healer
C_STOP healer
C_SETANGLETO healer 0
IF save:19 = 1 @healer-look
IF save:19 = 0 @healer-first

# Anyone short of health or mind, the hero or the companion, is healed.
[sentence healer-look]
SETFLAG temp:2 -1
SETFLAG temp:8 0
GETPLAYERLIFE temp:6 temp:7
IF temp:6 ! temp:7 @healer-needed
GETPLAYERMENTAL temp:6 temp:7
IF temp:6 ! temp:7 @healer-needed
GETPARTNERLIFE temp:6 temp:7
IF temp:6 ! temp:7 @healer-needed
IF temp:8 = 1 @healer-pray
IF temp:8 = 0 @healer-well

[sentence healer-needed]
SETFLAG temp:8 1

[sentence healer-pray]
SETFLAG temp:16 msg:182
TALK msg:182 -1 0 -1 -1 -1

[sentence healer-well]
SETFLAG temp:16 msg:183
TALK temp:16 -1 0 -1 -1 -1

[sentence healer-first]
TALK msg:179 -1 0 -1 -1 -1
SETFLAG temp:2 10
SETFLAG save:19 1

[sentence healer-end]
on=talk-end healer
IF temp:2 = 0 @healer-free
IF temp:2 = 11 @healer-h11
IF temp:2 = 10 @healer-h10
IF temp:2 = -1 @healer-after

[sentence healer-free]
C_MOVABLE healer

[sentence healer-h11]
SETFLAG temp:2 0
TALK msg:181 -1 0 -1 -1 -1

[sentence healer-h10]
SETFLAG temp:2 11
TALK msg:180 -1 0 -1 -1 -1

[sentence healer-after]
C_MOVABLE healer
IF temp:16 = msg:182 @healer-heal

# (The original also has her play her casting motion, C_ACTIONREQ healer
# 4, which the engine does not carry out yet.)
[sentence healer-heal]
HEALLIFE
HEALMENTAL
PLAYSOUND 24 0 x:healer y:healer

# ---- The wizard: the ruins and the Tower of Ordeal (save:20) ---------------

[message 184]
I'm a wizard, though not much of one.

[message 185]
Newly hired, are you?
...Hm. There's a light in your eyes.

[message 186]
Let me tell you something worth knowing.

[message 187]
Three ruins and a tower lie around this town:
the Cold Ruins to the northwest,
the Purgatory of Judgments to the southeast,
the Remains of Reincarnation to the southwest,
and the Tower of Ordeal to the north.

[message 188]
Our forebears raised towns and walls to keep watch over
the ruins, yet monsters have made all three their dens.
Be wary of them.

The Tower of Ordeal is kept by wizards.
Go there if you want to test your strength.

[message 189]
I don't like what I sense in the creatures around here.
They could do far more harm than goblins and other small
fry. Take care of yourself.

[message 190]
I hear you beat the gargoyles of the Immortal Remains.
That is no small feat.

[message 191]
Would you like harder training in the Tower of Ordeal,
north of town? I'll let my fellow wizards know about you.

[message 192]
Good luck.

[sentence wizard]
on=talk wizard
C_STOP wizard
C_SETANGLETO wizard 0
IF save:20 ! 0 @wizard-known
IF save:20 = 0 @wizard-first

[sentence wizard-known]
SETFLAG temp:15 0
IF save:20 = 2 @wizard-luck
IF save:20 = 1 @wizard-done
IF temp:15 = 0 @wizard-warn

[sentence wizard-luck]
SETFLAG temp:2 0
TALK msg:192 -1 0 -1 -1 -1
SETFLAG temp:15 1

[sentence wizard-done]
IF quest:10 = 2 @wizard-praise

[sentence wizard-praise]
SETFLAG temp:2 20
TALK msg:190 -1 0 -1 -1 -1
SETFLAG save:20 2
SETFLAG temp:15 1

[sentence wizard-warn]
SETFLAG temp:2 0
TALK msg:189 -1 0 -1 -1 -1

[sentence wizard-first]
SETFLAG temp:2 10
TALK msg:184 -1 0 -1 -1 -1
SETFLAG save:20 1

[sentence wizard-end]
on=talk-end wizard
IF temp:2 = 0 @wizard-free
IF temp:2 = 20 @wizard-tower
IF temp:2 = 13 @wizard-w13
IF temp:2 = 12 @wizard-w12
IF temp:2 = 11 @wizard-w11
IF temp:2 = 10 @wizard-w10

[sentence wizard-free]
C_MOVABLE wizard

[sentence wizard-tower]
SETFLAG temp:2 0
TALK msg:191 -1 0 -1 -1 -1

[sentence wizard-w13]
SETFLAG temp:2 0
TALK msg:188 -1 0 -1 -1 -1

[sentence wizard-w12]
SETFLAG temp:2 13
TALK msg:187 -1 0 -1 -1 -1

[sentence wizard-w11]
SETFLAG temp:2 12
TALK msg:186 -1 0 -1 -1 -1

[sentence wizard-w10]
SETFLAG temp:2 11
TALK msg:185 -1 0 -1 -1 -1

# ---- The ornament smith (save:102) -----------------------------------------
# The first time he introduces himself over two boxes. After that the
# original opens its recoloring window (CHANGECOLOR), which the engine does
# not carry out yet; until it does, he repeats his offer instead.

[message 196]
Hello there. I'm a smith, though I mostly make ornaments.

[message 197]
How about a new color for your gear?
A fresh look does wonders for the spirits.

[sentence jeweler]
on=talk jeweler
IF save:102 = 1 @jeweler-color
IF save:102 = 0 @jeweler-first

[sentence jeweler-color]
# CHANGECOLOR
C_STOP jeweler
C_SETANGLETO jeweler 0
SETFLAG temp:2 1
SETFLAG temp:3 msg:197
TALK temp:3 -1 0 -1 -1 -1

[sentence jeweler-first]
SETFLAG temp:3 msg:196
SETFLAG temp:2 0
SETFLAG save:102 1
C_STOP jeweler
C_SETANGLETO jeweler 0
TALK temp:3 -1 0 -1 -1 -1

[sentence jeweler-end]
on=talk-end jeweler
IF temp:2 = 1 @jeweler-last
IF temp:2 = -1 @jeweler-free
IF temp:2 ! -1 @jeweler-next

[sentence jeweler-last]
SETFLAG temp:2 -1

[sentence jeweler-free]
C_MOVABLE jeweler

[sentence jeweler-next]
ADD temp:2 1
ADD temp:3 1
TALK temp:3 -1 0 -1 -1 -1

