[message 1000000]
Forest of Knight's Misery

[message 1000001]
Fort of Thieves

[message 1000002]
And who might you be?

[message 1000003]
What I'm up to out here
is no concern of yours.

[message 1000004]
Go on, clear off.

[message 1000005]
Can't find a way into the Fort of Thieves,
and it's bothering you?

[message 1000006]
For 200 Gold I'll let you in on something
worth knowing. Interested?

                ~Yes~  ~No~

[message 1000007]
Heh heh heh...
Someone left an odd mark on the ground west of
here, just south of the Fort of Thieves.

[message 1000008]
Go stand on that mark.
You might like what happens.

[message 1000009]
You haven't got the coin.

[message 1000010]
Heh heh heh.
West of here. South of the fort.

