[message 1000000]
Tower of the Wizard, 1F

[message 1000001]
Tower of the Wizard, 2F

[message 1000002]
Tower of the Wizard, 3F

[message 1000003]
Tower of the Wizard, 4F

[message 1000004]
Tower of the Wizard, 5F

[message 1000005]
Tower of the Wizard, 6F

[message 1000006]
Tower of the Wizard, 7F

[message 1000007]
Tower of the Wizard, 8F

[message 1000008]
Tower of the Wizard, 9F

[message 1000009]
Tower of the Wizard, 10F

[message 1000010]
Tower of the Wizard

[message 1000011]
A fighter, are you?
Forgive me, I've no time just now.

[message 1000012]
Ah, welcome, young one.
I am Orsolan, a wizard.

[message 1000013]
The elves' village won't let you pass, and that
troubles you. Did you know the dragons are why?

[message 1000014]
The dragons sealed in the mine are only young,
yet even so few creatures alive can match them.
They are far stronger than the great lizard
the knights brought down.

[message 1000015]
Let those dragons out of their prison,
and this whole land would burn.

[message 1000016]
That is why
the seal works are so closely watched.
We have kept everyone away...

[message 1000017]
But a band of thieves prowling these parts
learned that the dragons are here. The fools
have been trying to break the seal.

[message 1000018]
Should they manage it, it would be their death.
They don't seem to grasp that...

[message 1000019]
Some of the elves who guarded the works were
called away to the war, and the thieves made
use of the gap to seize the place.

[message 1000020]
The seal is strong
and won't give way easily.
I hope they'll tire of it soon,
but they keep at it.

[message 1000021]
Worse, the thieves took the seal crystal,
the key that opens the seal works.

[message 1000022]
It was kept under lock and guard,
and still they got it.

[message 1000023]
Now the elves are more afraid than ever.
Some whisper that humans took the crystal
to turn the dragons into weapons of war.
The elves trust no one now.

[message 1000024]
So I need your help.
The thieves carried the crystal to their fort in
the Forest of Knight's Misery, west of Cross Agora.

[message 1000025]
They mean to use the crystal
to break the seal.

[message 1000026]
Take the crystal back before they succeed.
Do that, and you'll show the elves that
humans can be trusted.

[message 1000027]
You are the only one I can rely on.
Will you take this on?

[message 1000028]
Good fortune go with you...

[message 1000029]
You brought it back! Thank you!
I'll send word to the elves' village.
They'll let you in now.

[message 1000030]
Don't breathe easy yet...
One of the thieves was cleverer than the rest.
Parts of the seal are broken already...

[message 1000031]
We must be quick...

[message 1000032]
The dragons are waking.
They must be stopped!

[message 1000033]
Remarkable!
You defeated the dragons! Though, to be fair,
the seal had sapped much of their strength...

[message 1000034]
Hollis...
Merrit...
Calder...

[message 1000035]
My friends, burned by the dragons' fire, can
rest in peace at last, wherever they are...

[message 1000036]
You've avenged my friends. I, Orsolan, thank
you with all my heart.

[message 1000037]
Please take this small gift
as a sign of my thanks.

[message 1000038]
May the heavens watch over you.

