The Road of Atonement

[message 1000002]
These ruins belong to the grimling faith.
Keep out unless the faith has sent you.

[message 1000003]
Beyond here is Saint Seren's shrine, a holy place.
No one enters without leave.

[message 1000004]
So you're the warrior Lord Valdric sent word of.
Go on through.

