[message 1000000]
East Losmans

[message 1000001]
The town is still mending after the enemy's raids.
Nobody goes in for now. Those are my orders.

[message 1000002]
A letter from Bishop Aurel in Antalusia, you say?
Let me have a look at it.

[message 1000003]
Even so, I can't open the gate just yet.
It has to do with the town walls, I think.
Nobody tells me more than that.

[message 1000004]
The walls are mended at last.
The gate is open to you now.

