[message 1000000]
Tower of Nazzle, 1F

[message 1000001]
This tower is for the training of clergy.
Please leave.

[message 1000002]
We come here to train of our own free will,
so nobody has to give us leave.

[message 1000003]
If you carry a letter from Bishop Aurel,
you may go in.

[message 1000004]
The tower's warding devices are broken, so some
foes inside may be beyond your power to defeat.
Take care.

[message 1000005]
Don't push yourself too hard.

[message 1000006]
Run into any demons?
We've never been up the stairs,
so we can't say what's waiting up there.

[message 1000007]
This tower is for the training of clergy.

