[message 1000000]
South Camp of Yugunos

[message 1000001]
South Camp of Yugunos

[message 1000002]
Good, you made it.
I'm Garron. I lead the surprise attack.

[message 1000003]
Your name got here before you did. You're the
ones who put down the dragon that slept
under the mining tunnel, aren't you?

[message 1000004]
A word of advice, though: try not to wake
any more dragons. One mess like that is plenty.

[message 1000005]
Now, to business. Some of the demons got away,
and I want them hunted down.

[message 1000006]
Word is they're digging in at the foot of
Mt. Tedoron, north of East Antalusia.

[message 1000007]
Get out there and see for yourselves.

[message 1000008]
Fine work, all of it. Every fight like that
makes you sharper.

[message 1000009]
Your next task has to do with Rowan...

[message 1000010]
Somehow the demons got their hands on
something precious of his. Don't ask me how.

[message 1000011]
Go and find out what happened. It's yours
to handle now.

[message 1000012]
Go and find out what happened. It's yours
to handle now.

[message 1000013]
Rowan has another job for you, too.
Do as he asks.

[message 1000014]
Trading, then? Or shall I mend your gear,
or tell you what something is?

  ~Buy weapons           ~
  ~Buy gear              ~
  ~Identify items        ~
  ~Repair items          ~
                              ~Leave~

[message 1000015]
  ~Weapon             %9d Gold~
  ~Helmet             %9d Gold~
  ~Body armor         %9d Gold~
  ~Shield             %9d Gold~
  ~Boots              %9d Gold~
  ~Everything worn    %9d Gold~
  ~Everything carried %9d Gold~
                          ~Leave~

[message 1000016]
You're short on gold.

[message 1000017]
Hm. Not a scratch on any of it.

[message 1000018]
Identifying that comes to %d Gold. All right?

                         ~Yes~  ~No~

[message 1000019]
You've got nothing that needs identifying.

[message 1000020]
Name's Fitch. The army posted me out here
to keep this camp supplied.

[message 1000021]
That surprise attack went off without a hitch.
Good news for all of us.

[message 1000022]
I'm Pim. I heal by the spirits' grace.

[message 1000023]
If you come back hurt or worn out,
look for me.

[message 1000024]
And if it's bad, come all the sooner.
Believe me, I'm not short of free time.

[message 1000025]
Spirits, hear me!
Close their wounds!

[message 1000026]
Drop by whenever you like.

[message 1000027]
Oh dear... oh dear, oh dear...

[message 1000028]
Why, you're the hero who slew the
ancient dragon!

[message 1000029]
Everyone's been talking about you.

[message 1000030]
Please, I'm desperate. A demon carried off
the Sacred Feather, holy relic of Valmere,
the White Angel. We grimlings revere it.

[message 1000031]
It was in my care, and if it isn't found,
the blame falls on me...
Would you bring the Sacred Feather back?

[message 1000032]
The demon fled with it to the south side
of the forest.

[message 1000033]
I can't thank you enough.

[message 1000034]
I can't thank you enough.

[message 1000035]
The Tower of Nazzle? How odd.
I had no idea any of our faith were
training in that tower.

[message 1000036]
Would you take this letter to Bishop Aurel
in Antalusia, west of the forest?
See what he can tell you.

[message 1000037]
Show them this letter and they'll
let you into the town.

[message 1000038]
Thank you.

[message 1000039]
Losing the Sacred Feather was my fault, and
the faith has cast me out for it. I'm going
home. Bishop Aurel will give you your tasks
from now on.

[message 1000040]
Valmere watch over you!

