[message 1000000]
Town of Calado

[message 1000001]
Town of Calado

[message 1000002]
Hm? And who might you be?

[message 1000003]
Heh. I know you. The sellsword out hunting
for the Moonwell Tear, right?

[message 1000004]
Hand me 20,000 Gold and I'll tell you
something worth hearing. Deal?

                         ~Yes~  ~No~

[message 1000005]
Fool!

[message 1000006]
Smart choice. You'll go far.

[message 1000007]
Look for a Warp Gate close by and use it
to reach a warp point you haven't found yet.

[message 1000008]
Keep at it.

[message 1000009]
You're short on gold.

[message 1000010]
Well? Are you buying or just looking?

  ~Buy weapons           ~
  ~Buy gear              ~
  ~Identify items        ~
  ~Repair items          ~
                              ~Leave~

[message 1000011]
  ~Weapon             %9d Gold~
  ~Helmet             %9d Gold~
  ~Body armor         %9d Gold~
  ~Shield             %9d Gold~
  ~Boots              %9d Gold~
  ~Everything worn    %9d Gold~
  ~Everything carried %9d Gold~
                          ~Leave~

[message 1000012]
You're short on gold.

[message 1000013]
Nothing here needs mending.

[message 1000014]
Identifying that comes to %d Gold. All right?

                         ~Yes~  ~No~

[message 1000015]
There's nothing you don't already know about.

[message 1000016]
I'm Oren. I opened my shop in this town
twenty years ago now.

[message 1000017]
Calado was a growing place in those days.

[message 1000018]
The land north of town is too dangerous.
The way up there has been shut.

[message 1000019]
I'm Tibbs. I heal by the spirits' grace.

[message 1000020]
In my people's old tongue, Tibbs means
"little acorn". I can't stand acorns.

[message 1000021]
Spirits, hear me!
Close their wounds!

[message 1000022]
There. You look fit and well again.

[message 1000023]
I'm Vasco, the smith. Fine finishing work
is what I do best.

[message 1000024]
Tired of your gear's look? I could give
your armor a new color.

[message 1000025]
Who are you?

[message 1000026]
You've got honest eyes.
Here's something for you.

[message 1000027]
Mandragora grows on Lunafuld Beach.

[message 1000028]
Who are you?

[message 1000029]
I've heard there's a secret medicine, the
Clearmind Tonic, hidden in the ruins of
Coldea, out in the Mesrald Burial Grounds.

[message 1000030]
I wonder what it's good for.

[message 1000031]
My, this town isn't safe anymore.

[message 1000032]
I really should get myself fit.

[message 1000033]
Anyway, the Plain of Dialose is littered
with fallen walnuts. Go and gather some.

[message 1000034]
What is it?

[message 1000035]
Have you ever had sugarnuts? They're
wonderful.

[message 1000036]
I'm told you'll find plenty of them at the
Meria Ruin in Goronaburb.

[message 1000037]
Hmm...

[message 1000038]
If only I had some Clearmind Tonic...
Hmm...

[message 1000039]
Oh!?

[message 1000040]
Is that Clearmind Tonic!?
Where did you find it?

[message 1000041]
Let me have it, and I'll give you
something rare for it.

