[message 1000000]
Ponse, Village of Dwarves

[message 1000001]
Ponse, Village of Dwarves

[message 1000002]
And you are?
Unless it matters, leave me be.

[message 1000003]
An antidote that cures any poison?
That's what you're after?

[message 1000004]
It won't come cheap, mind.

[message 1000005]
Are the grimlings paying for it?

[message 1000006]
Hmm... very well.
But don't expect a perfect cure.

[message 1000007]
I'm out of Ponero fruit, though,
and the antidote can't be made without it.

[message 1000008]
It grows on the trees inside Ponero Cave,
to the south of the Moldona Peninsula...

[message 1000009]
Could you bring me some of that fruit?

[message 1000010]
Bring me the fruit and I'll make
the antidote right away.

[message 1000011]
Ah, that's the fruit!
Give me a moment to brew it.

[message 1000012]
...

[message 1000013]
...

[message 1000014]
Done! An antidote for any poison.

[message 1000015]
You fetched the fruit yourself,
so this one costs you nothing.

[message 1000016]
Well? What do you need?

[message 1000017]
More Ponero fruit? Don't tell me
you need another antidote already.

[message 1000018]
Try to hang on to this one.

[message 1000019]
Come to buy something?

  ~Buy weapons           ~
  ~Buy gear              ~
  ~Identify items        ~
  ~Repair items          ~
                              ~Leave~

[message 1000020]
  ~Weapon             %9d Gold~
  ~Helmet             %9d Gold~
  ~Body armor         %9d Gold~
  ~Shield             %9d Gold~
  ~Boots              %9d Gold~
  ~Everything worn    %9d Gold~
  ~Everything carried %9d Gold~
                          ~Leave~

[message 1000021]
You can't afford that.

[message 1000022]
Nothing here needs mending.

[message 1000023]
Identifying that comes to %d Gold. All right?

                         ~Yes~  ~No~

[message 1000024]
There's nothing unknown here.

[message 1000025]
I'm Brokk. Trading in a dwarf village
suits me down to the ground.

[message 1000026]
Dwarves fight with axes and nothing else,
so axes are all the weapons I stock.

[message 1000027]
There's an apothecary in the village too,
so I keep all sorts of medicine.

[message 1000028]
I'm Wynn, the spirit healer here.

[message 1000029]
Count yourself lucky you don't live here.
Nothing ever happens!

[message 1000030]
Spirits, hear me! Close their wounds!

[message 1000031]
You look fine to me.

[message 1000032]
A sellsword, are you?
Hargrim's the name. I'm the smith.

[message 1000033]
Old things are my weakness. Find me an
ancient short sword and I'll make it
worth your while.

[message 1000034]
Thanks.

[message 1000035]
Would you look at that!
An ancient short sword, the real thing!

[message 1000036]
I'm in your debt, friend!

[message 1000037]
From now on, all your repairs are free.

[message 1000038]
Bring me anything that needs fixing
and I'll see to it.

[message 1000039]
Hmm...

[message 1000040]
Here's a secret for you.

[message 1000041]
They say a vitality potion lies in the
Ruins of Carn, in the Mesrald Burial Grounds.

[message 1000042]
And who are you?

[message 1000043]
I hear a peddler of tablets lives in Wog
Cave, down in the Valley of Dying People.

[message 1000044]
Pay him a visit if you've the time.

[message 1000045]
Hello there.

[message 1000046]
I'm told someone in Mour Cave, on Lunafuld
Beach, sells capsules.

[message 1000047]
Takes all sorts to make a world.

[message 1000048]
Me? You want me?

[message 1000049]
What I'd give for a handful of goji berries.

[message 1000050]
Folk say they grow at the Ruins of Goldo,
along the Road of Atonement.

[message 1000051]
Hmm...

[message 1000052]
If only I had some akebi fruit...
Hmm...

[message 1000053]
Hmm...!?

[message 1000054]
Is that akebi fruit? Where did you get it?
No, forget I asked. It doesn't matter.

[message 1000055]
If you'll let me have it, I'll give you
something rare in return.

[message 1000056]
Did you want something from me?

[message 1000057]
They say there's a learned man who
studies the ruins of this world.

[message 1000058]
I wonder what he's looking into
these days.

[message 1000059]
Well, hello there.

[message 1000060]
You're the sellsword who's been poking
around the Sages' Ruins, aren't you?

[message 1000061]
Give me 80,000 Gold and I'll tell you
something interesting. Deal?

                         ~Yes~  ~No~

[message 1000062]
Spoken like a true fighter.

[message 1000063]
You're one of a kind.

[message 1000064]
Step onto the warp rune over there.

[message 1000065]
Don't lose heart.

[message 1000066]
You're short on gold.

[message 1000067]
I've got some fine wares today.

