[message 1000000]
Sena's Small Shrine

[message 1000001]
Sena's Small Shrine

[message 1000002]
Oh, a visitor! We hardly ever have guests here.

[message 1000003]
Who might you be?
And what can I do for you?

[message 1000004]
Lord Valdric means to hand the holy relics
over to me, now?

[message 1000005]
...

[message 1000006]
...

[message 1000007]
...

[message 1000008]
Well, you're welcome at my shrine whenever you like.

[message 1000009]
I am Seren, and in a sense I am Valmere too.
Some call me the White Angel herself, but it is
her spirit I share, more than her face.

[message 1000010]
You might say she dwells in my body. The holy relics,
and the coming of Morvane, the fiend, have woken
Valmere's spirit inside me.

[message 1000011]
...

[message 1000012]
I see.
You mean to go to Aurion and learn the truth.

[message 1000013]
A wise choice. But you are mortal, so to bear
Morvane's power you'll need all five orbs.

[message 1000014]
I can tell you already hold two of them.

[message 1000015]
First, go to an old research hall, a ruin close
to Berini Village. The blue and green orbs
are kept there.

[message 1000016]
Once you have them,
please come back to me.

[message 1000017]
Oh, it's you. You've been coming by quite often.

[message 1000018]
Oh, it's you. You've been coming by quite often.

[message 1000019]
...

[message 1000020]
...

[message 1000021]
...

[message 1000022]
So you've found the blue and green orbs?

[message 1000023]
With them, you may be able to stand up
to Morvane's power now.

[message 1000024]
The last one, the Red Orb, is kept
in a tower in Berini Village.

[message 1000025]
Come back to me once it's yours.

[message 1000026]
Hello. That must have been a long, hard road.
Can I offer you some coffee?

[message 1000027]
Hello.

[message 1000028]
...

[message 1000029]
...

[message 1000030]
So you have every one of the orbs now.

[message 1000031]
I can feel their magic moving inside you.

[message 1000032]
...

[message 1000033]
Then I'll tell you all of it, even what
the grimling faith itself does not know.

[message 1000034]
...

[message 1000035]
Long ago, humankind stood at its height.
Science, the thing you call the craft of the
ancient world, let people work wonders,
and everyone lived in comfort.

[message 1000036]
Their power was so great they could even rule
the weather. They turned deserts into meadows
and made frozen wastes fit to live in.

[message 1000037]
In that world, Morvane and I
were both scientists.

[message 1000038]
All was peaceful, until one day it wasn't...

[message 1000039]
Morvane was a brilliant scientist. Together we
studied the hidden potential of human beings.

[message 1000040]
Put simply, we searched for ways to make people
stronger and help them live longer.

[message 1000041]
And our work led us to a remarkable discovery.

[message 1000042]
Yet that same discovery
was where the end began...

[message 1000043]
At first people cheered what we had done
and hailed it as a great achievement.
It didn't last. They soon turned on us
and called our work evil.

[message 1000044]
Morvane's work on strengthening people drew
the worst of it. In the end he was branded
an enemy of all humankind.

[message 1000045]
It wounded him deeply. He was sure his work
was meant for the good of everyone.

[message 1000046]
So he kept at it, hoping that one day people
would understand and welcome what he had made.

[message 1000047]
And then it happened...

[message 1000048]
The army was ordered to seize him. And it was not
only Morvane they came for. His family was judged
guilty alongside him, and they...

[message 1000049]
...

[message 1000050]
He was never the same again.

[message 1000051]
The army forced Morvane to work for them,
and he turned to experiments of a darker kind.

[message 1000052]
What he made frightened the army; they feared his
power was beyond holding. They moved to lock him up
and end his work, but Morvane had seen it coming
and was ready for them.

[message 1000053]
He made himself into a mighty, demonlike creature
and raised an army of others like him. With a
living plague he turned anyone it touched into one
of them. Truly, it was a dark and evil magic.

[message 1000054]
He was eaten up with hatred
for all humankind...
No one could stop him.
The plague spread beyond counting.

[message 1000055]
The few who lived were those who could shield
themselves from the plague, scientists and soldiers.
But even for them, it was only a matter of time
before nearly all were changed or killed.

[message 1000056]
I had been his partner and shared his research.
It seemed only right that I, with what I knew,
should be the one to stop him.

[message 1000057]
I followed his path and made myself one of his
demons, then hunted him down and sealed him away.
It cost me dearly. My body was broken by it.

[message 1000058]
That is how this world came to be cursed.
I believe Morvane has now risen again from Aurion,
where I sealed him.

[message 1000059]
The five orbs hold the power to stand against his
magic. With my holy crest, you can call on it.

[message 1000060]
The spirit crest, too,
can restore your strength.

[message 1000061]
I tell you all this because I sense
a rare power in you.

[message 1000062]
I hope what I've told you helps you become all
you can be. This world's fate rests with you now.

[message 1000063]
Go to Aurion,
and do what you believe is right for this world.

[message 1000064]
Hello. How have you been?

[message 1000065]
I see...

[message 1000066]
As you know, Morvane all but destroyed the world.
What he did can never be forgiven.

[message 1000067]
But please remember, at least, that had things gone
another way, he might have been humankind's savior.

[message 1000068]
And as for you...

[message 1000069]
...

[message 1000070]
The whole world is grateful for what you've done.
I'll go on living in this body, keeping Valmere's
spirit with me until the end of my days.

[message 1000071]
If you're ever passing this way, please visit me.

[message 1000072]
Oh, hello there!

[message 1000073]
This may be asking too much of you,
but I know you're the only one
who can help me.

[message 1000074]
After Morvane was sealed away, the strongest of
the demons that served him gathered at the Fort of
Demons.

[message 1000075]
They are weaker than Morvane himself,
but strong all the same, and they could wreak
havoc if no one deals with them.

[message 1000076]
The burrow in Ento Village leads to the Fort of
Demons, but it was made for demons alone. Without
the Fiend's Tooth, no human can pass through it.

[message 1000077]
The demons of the Forest of Poison once had the
Fiend's Tooth, but I don't know where it is now.

[message 1000078]
Will you go and defeat the demons
at the Fort of Demons for me?

[message 1000079]
Be sure you come back alive.
I'll be waiting to hear how it went.

[message 1000080]
Thank you, truly.
Please take this Fellowship Stone as thanks.
With it, your companions take less time
to recover.

[message 1000081]
Oh, the demons at the Fort of Demons were people
once. The plague robbed them of their reason.

[message 1000082]
Also, the demons at the Fort of Demons and the Ruins
of Remoteness seem fond of rare curios,
and hoard as many as they can.

[message 1000083]
And it might help to know that the Fiend's Tooth
is said to restore spiritual power.

[message 1000084]
Is that of any help to you?

[message 1000085]
Hello.

[message 1000086]
Thank you so much.

[message 1000087]
I've got fine wares here.

  ~Buy items             ~
  ~Identify items        ~
  ~Repair items          ~
                              ~Leave~

[message 1000088]
  ~Weapon             %9d Gold~
  ~Helmet             %9d Gold~
  ~Body armor         %9d Gold~
  ~Shield             %9d Gold~
  ~Boots              %9d Gold~
  ~Everything worn    %9d Gold~
  ~Everything carried %9d Gold~
                          ~Leave~

[message 1000089]
You can't afford that.

[message 1000090]
Nothing here needs mending.

[message 1000091]
Identifying that comes to %d Gold. All right?

                         ~Yes~  ~No~

[message 1000092]
There's nothing unknown here.

[message 1000093]
Kestrel

  ~Check status~
  ~About me~
  ~Swap~

          ~Leave~

[message 1000094]
Count on me, above all when it comes to attacking.

[message 1000095]
I'd be glad of any items
that build up my stamina.

