[message 1000000]
The Ancient Institute

[message 1000001]
Laboratory for growing human copies.
Authorized staff only.

[message 1000002]
This hall answers to Valmere.
Authorized staff only.

[message 1000003]
Past this door, researchers alone.
Authorized staff only.

[message 1000004]
No one may go beyond this point
unless Valmere herself allows it.

[message 1000005]
Specimen storage.

[message 1000006]
Specimen name: Seren.

[message 1000007]
This apparatus keeps Seren, the copy
grown from Valmere, preserved.
Hands off unless you have leave.

