[message 1000000]
Tower of Rebellion, 4F

[message 1000001]
And who might you be?
You've no business up here.

[message 1000002]
So... Lord Valdric sent you, did he?

[message 1000003]
You'd slander Archbishop Krator!?
Who could think he turned into a demon?
I won't hear it!

[message 1000004]
Hm? Mrs. Krator, you say?

[message 1000005]
Impossible!
How would someone like you know her?

[message 1000006]
What did you say?

[message 1000007]
.....

[message 1000008]
She asked this of you...
It was her wish that sent you up here?

[message 1000009]
.....

[message 1000010]
Very well. We'll give up the tower.
The archbishop would grieve to know
our stand had brought his wife harm.

[message 1000011]
Our revolt is over. Please let her know.

[message 1000012]
Wh-who goes there?

[message 1000013]
So it's finished...

[message 1000014]
How did you get up here?

[message 1000015]
Mercy... please, don't kill me!

[message 1000016]
Get back!

[message 1000017]
I haven't done anything!

