[message 1000000]
The Ruins of The Wise

[message 1000001]
Well, well! A visitor, of all things.

[message 1000002]
So Eskil has sent someone my way at last.
Hm? Oh, it's nothing. Pay me no mind.

[message 1000003]
My name is Ezra. I study illusion magic,
the craft behind the Tower of Trials
here in these ruins.

[message 1000004]
The grimling faith forbids such study,
so I carry on with it in secret.

[message 1000005]
I'll teach you a spell called Identify.
Just keep it from the grimlings. Our secret.

[message 1000006]
Is there something else you need?

[message 1000007]
Hm? Who are you,
and what are you doing here?

