[message 1000005]
That's in fine shape. Nothing to fix.

[message 1000006]
I can tell you what it is for %d Gold. Deal?

                         ~Yes~  ~No~

[message 1000007]
You've nothing I need to identify.

[message 1000008]
Name's Mabry.

[message 1000009]
I kept a shop in Berini Village,
just a little way down the road.

[message 1000010]
The monsters out there keep growing bolder,
so I packed up and came here to the gate.

[message 1000011]
Whatever you're after, just ask.

[message 1000012]
I'm Thea.

[message 1000013]
I served in Berini Village until it grew
too dangerous. They moved me here instead.

[message 1000014]
Spirits, hear me!
Mend these wounds!

[message 1000015]
If you get hurt out there, come find me.

