[message 1000000]
Ento Village

[message 1000001]
Ento Village

[message 1000002]
...

[message 1000003]
So, a visitor. Be welcome.

[message 1000004]
You stand in Ento Village, where demons live.
Every one of us was human once, before
Aurion's power changed us.

[message 1000005]
That power grows a little more each day,
and what is left of the people we were
gets harder to hold on to...

[message 1000006]
Somehow it has passed you by.
That is why I have a favor to ask.

[message 1000007]
Demons have taken the Ruins of Exorcism on
Orphe Beach. Will you win them back? To reach
the beach, go west through the Demon's Forest.

[message 1000008]
There is no one else we can turn to.

[message 1000009]
We are all relying on you.

[message 1000010]
You have our thanks.
Please, take this for your trouble.

[message 1000011]
The magic has grown fiercer of late.
I fear something is coming.

[message 1000012]
Aurion's power has touched you, yet you are
still human. Only strong magic of your own
could protect you like that.

[message 1000013]
...

[message 1000014]
Valmere herself gave you this...?

[message 1000015]
Morvane, the devil? Is that who you seek?

[message 1000016]
They say the Devil's Castle lies at Aurion's
western edge. None of us has ever ventured
that deep, so I cannot promise it.

[message 1000017]
The creatures that prowl these parts
carry a demon's strength.
Stay on your guard.

[message 1000018]
Stay on your guard.

[message 1000019]
The gate of the Devil's Castle is sealed?
Then there is nothing we can do for you.
Still, I think you will find a way inside!

[message 1000020]
Ah, one more thing. I've heard that Morvane
keeps a servant he trusts above all others,
by the name of Goliate.

[message 1000021]
Goliate's mansion stands somewhere in Aurion.

[message 1000022]
Track him down, and he may lead
you to Morvane.

[message 1000023]
Hmm...

[message 1000024]
Goliate too? You beat him as well?!

[message 1000025]
I can hardly believe it!

[message 1000026]
...

[message 1000027]
What drives you toward the Devil's Castle,
I cannot say...

[message 1000028]
But if his power keeps on growing, it will
not stop at Aurion. It will spread to the
lands beyond as well.

[message 1000029]
None of us can go back to the outside world.
We are afraid of how far the darkness
has taken us.

[message 1000030]
If only you had the strength
to bring Morvane down...

[message 1000031]
Will you face Morvane, so that no one else
has to end up the way we have?

[message 1000032]
I beg you.

[message 1000033]
I beg you.

[message 1000034]
Thank you. We can never be wholly human again,
but at least the demon power should
spread no further.

[message 1000035]
It is a poor reward, but Giant Warehouse VIII
is yours to use from now on.

[message 1000036]
We owe you more than we can say.

[message 1000037]
Well? Are you buying or just looking?

  ~Buy weapons           ~
  ~Buy gear              ~
  ~Identify items        ~
  ~Repair items          ~
                              ~Leave~

[message 1000038]
  ~Weapon             %9d Gold~
  ~Helmet             %9d Gold~
  ~Body armor         %9d Gold~
  ~Shield             %9d Gold~
  ~Boots              %9d Gold~
  ~Everything worn    %9d Gold~
  ~Everything carried %9d Gold~
                          ~Leave~

[message 1000039]
You can't afford that.

[message 1000040]
Nothing here needs mending.

[message 1000041]
Identifying that comes to %d Gold. All right?

                         ~Yes~  ~No~

[message 1000042]
You've nothing on you that still needs a name.

[message 1000043]
Name's Grell. Don't ask me how,
but I ended up keeping shop in this village.

[message 1000044]
I suppose I just fancied setting up here.

[message 1000045]
Then one day something struck me out of nowhere,
and I turned into this ugly thing.

[message 1000046]
Anyway, go on and buy something.

[message 1000047]
(Growl)

[message 1000048]
My goods are worth a look.

[message 1000049]
(Growl)

[message 1000050]
(Roar)

[message 1000051]
This is Ento Village. Everyone here was
human, until a demon power took hold of us...

[message 1000052]
A village of demons, to put it plainly.

[message 1000053]
I was so ill I doubted I'd see another year.
I came to Aurion hoping to buy myself a little
more time, and yet...

[message 1000054]
How I wish I had never come.

[message 1000055]
Hard to believe, but I was a knight once.
I came to Aurion to learn its secrets.
And now look at me... a monster.

[message 1000056]
Each day I remember less of my life as a man.
One day soon I may lose my reason altogether.

[message 1000057]
Other children picked on me when I was small.
I wanted to be so strong that nobody
could ever push me around again.

[message 1000058]
I found that strength here. But it cost me
something worth far more.

[message 1000059]
Head a long way west and you'll come to
ruins. I was told the devil makes his home there.

[message 1000060]
Take care.
The evil in Aurion is beyond cruel.

[message 1000061]
I'd say this burrow is a way of getting about.
Not long ago I watched demons vanish into it.

[message 1000062]
So why does nothing happen when I step on it?

[message 1000063]
They say the grimlings once rounded up demons
and penned them in a forest somewhere.

[message 1000064]
Stay away from it. It's a demons' nest, and
not even the grimlings could keep it in hand.

[message 1000065]
I heard a wizard from Antalusia
was out looking for some ruins.

[message 1000066]
The Ruins of Remoteness, if I remember right.

