[message 1000000]
Light of the living,
close these wounds!

[message 1000001]
Come, let me tend to your hurts.

[message 1000002]
Keep your strength up.

[message 1000003]
Welcome, climber. Have a look at my wares.

  ~Buy and sell          ~
  ~Identify items        ~
  ~Repair items          ~
                              ~Leave~

[message 1000004]
  ~Weapon             %9d Gold~
  ~Helmet             %9d Gold~
  ~Body armor         %9d Gold~
  ~Shield             %9d Gold~
  ~Boots              %9d Gold~
  ~Everything worn    %9d Gold~
  ~Everything carried %9d Gold~
                          ~Leave~

[message 1000005]
You can't afford that.

[message 1000006]
Nothing here needs mending.

[message 1000007]
Identifying that comes to %d Gold. All right?

                         ~Yes~  ~No~

[message 1000008]
You've got nothing that needs identifying.

[message 1000009]
Tower of Ordeal, 1F

