[message 1000000]
Tower of Ordeal, 5F

[message 1000001]
So you reached this floor.
That was well fought.

[message 1000002]
Still, many more beasts wait above,
far worse than any you met below.

[message 1000003]
Gain more experience out in the world, then
return. More of this tower will open to you then.

[message 1000004]
If you need to grow stronger,
the warp gates will carry you far and wide.

