[message 1000000]
Tower of Ordeal, 12F

[message 1000001]
Tower of Ordeal, 12F

[message 1000002]
Well now, a climber! Nobody has come up
from the lower floors in a long while.

[message 1000003]
You will have guessed it by now: the beasts
of this tower are made here, by the tower's own
magic. Every one you fought below was such a one.

[message 1000004]
And the phantoms you met? When a demon dies
out in the world, its wicked shade drifts
back here to haunt these halls.

[message 1000005]
Did you face the dragon as well? I'll tell you,
I nearly died of fright the day someone
lured that beast into the tower.

[message 1000006]
That over there is the Giant Warehouse, the
greatest store of them all. It holds ten times
what any other warehouse can.

[message 1000007]
Leave your treasures there,
or anything you seldom need
to carry with you.

[message 1000008]
Others keep their things in the Giant Warehouse too.
If you'd like the use of their shelves,
ask them for leave first.

[message 1000009]
Grow stronger and wiser in the world,
then climb back up, and
I will open this door for you.

[message 1000010]
We are waiting for someone mightier to pass.
Finish more missions, then come back!

[message 1000011]
Light of the living,
close these wounds!

[message 1000012]
Come, let me tend to your hurts.

[message 1000013]
Keep your strength up.

[message 1000014]
Supplies for the climb? Take a look.

  ~Buy and sell          ~
  ~Identify items        ~
  ~Repair items          ~
                              ~Leave~

[message 1000015]
  ~Weapon             %9d Gold~
  ~Helmet             %9d Gold~
  ~Body armor         %9d Gold~
  ~Shield             %9d Gold~
  ~Boots              %9d Gold~
  ~Everything worn    %9d Gold~
  ~Everything carried %9d Gold~
                          ~Leave~

[message 1000016]
You can't afford that.

[message 1000017]
Nothing here needs mending.

[message 1000018]
Identifying that comes to %d Gold. All right?

                         ~Yes~  ~No~

[message 1000019]
You've got nothing that needs identifying.

