[message 1000000]
Tower of Ordeal, 17F

[message 1000001]
Tower of Ordeal, 17F

[message 1000002]
Oho... Fancy you climbing all the way up here.

[message 1000003]
Someone as able as you might just
gather every one of the magic cards.

[message 1000004]
Ah, the magic cards!

[message 1000005]
Nothing pleases me more than a hand
of Black Jack with those cards!

[message 1000006]
It's 10,000 Gold a hand.
Shall we?

    ~Yes~  ~No~

[message 1000007]
Don't be shy! Sit down and play!

[message 1000008]
That isn't enough gold.
Your purse is looking thin, friend.

[message 1000009]
The hand is mine.
Better luck next time.

[message 1000010]
Not bad. A tie this time.
Another hand?

        ~Yes~  ~No~

[message 1000011]
Not bad at all.
The stake rises to 20,000 Gold.
Another hand?

          ~Yes~  ~No~

[message 1000012]
Not bad at all.
The stake rises to 40,000 Gold.
Another hand?

          ~Yes~  ~No~

[message 1000013]
Not bad at all.
The stake rises to 60,000 Gold.
Another hand?

          ~Yes~  ~No~

[message 1000014]
Well, I never!
Nobody has ever played me like that.

Take this as your prize.
Come back for a hand whenever you like.

[message 1000015]
Well, I never!
Nobody has ever beaten me so soundly.

As your reward, the Giant Warehouse VI is yours to use.

[message 1000016]
Here is your prize. It's yours.

[message 1000017]
Light of the living,
close these wounds!

[message 1000018]
Come, let me tend to your hurts.

[message 1000019]
Keep your strength up.

[message 1000020]
Need anything for the climb? Look here.

  ~Buy and sell          ~
  ~Identify items        ~
  ~Repair items          ~
                              ~Leave~

[message 1000021]
  ~Weapon             %9d Gold~
  ~Helmet             %9d Gold~
  ~Body armor         %9d Gold~
  ~Shield             %9d Gold~
  ~Boots              %9d Gold~
  ~Everything worn    %9d Gold~
  ~Everything carried %9d Gold~
                          ~Leave~

[message 1000022]
You can't afford that.

[message 1000023]
Nothing here needs mending.

[message 1000024]
Identifying that comes to %d Gold. All right?

                         ~Yes~  ~No~

[message 1000025]
You've got nothing that needs identifying.

