[message 1000000]
Tower of Ordeal, Top Floor

[message 1000001]
Tower of Ordeal, Top Floor

[message 1000002]
Look at that!
You reached the very top
of the tower.

[message 1000003]
With skill like yours, you may well
hold every magic card already.

[message 1000004]
Oh, the magic cards!

[message 1000005]
There's no game I love more
than Black Jack with those cards.

[message 1000006]
Care for a hand? Win four in a row
and I'll pay you three times your stake.

  ~10,000 GOLD~
  ~20,000 GOLD~
  ~30,000 GOLD~
  ~40,000 GOLD~

[message 1000007]
Don't be shy! Sit down and play!

[message 1000008]
That isn't enough gold.
Running a little short, are we?

[message 1000009]
The hand is mine.
Better luck next time.

[message 1000010]
Not bad. That one was a tie.
Next hand!

[message 1000011]
Not bad at all.
Next hand!

[message 1000012]
Well, I never!
I've never met a player like you.

Take this as your prize.
Come back for a hand whenever you can.

[message 1000013]
Well, I never!
You're a fine player!

As your prize, the Giant Warehouse IX is yours to use.

[message 1000014]
You've beaten me fair and square!
Which prize will you take?
  ~Items~
  ~150,000GOLD~

[message 1000015]
Well played.
Here is your prize.

[message 1000016]
I have some very fine things for sale.

[message 1000017]
(A deep growl)

[message 1000018]
Beyond lies the road to the tower's Annex,
the hardest trial of all. Once you set out,
there is no turning back. Prepare yourself.

[sentence s0]
on=start
INITTRADE 2 38
SETCOMPASSES msg:1000000
GETENTRYPOINT temp:1000005
IF temp:1000005 = 50 @s1

