# consumable 10000000, Gold special 0), so the starting kit works with
# either. Stats and prices are our own. Pictures: icon=0,<n> is frame n of
# System/Game/Pattern/Item0000.sheet, ground=7,<n> frame n of
# Character/ITEM/00000007/Pattern.sheet, both rendered by tools/art/items.py
# in the order of its ITEMS list.

