# The missions' titles and descriptions, by the number SETQUESTFLAG takes,
# standing in for the original's Table.Tbd tables 41 and 700 on. Our own
# words; see docs/content.md.

[mission 0]
title=Drive off the beast on the north-east road.
text=Something has been hunting along the road
text=north-east of Remote Town. The healer at the
text=shrine asked me to deal with it.
text=
text=Find it and drive it off, so the people here
text=may sleep again.

[mission 1]
title=Win back the smith's sapphire.
text=A goblin chief who hides south-west of Remote
text=Town stole a sapphire from the smith, who
text=trades in town.
text=
text=Find the chief and bring the stone back to him.

[mission 2]
title=Win back the healer's shrine stone.
text=The healer at Remote Town's shrine cannot work
text=her cures without her shrine stone. Goblins
text=carried it off to the Dusty Ruins, north-west
text=of town.
text=
text=Search the ruins and bring the stone back.

[mission 3]
title=Clear the Dusty Ruins.
text=The goblins that prowl round Remote Town come
text=from the Dusty Ruins to the north-west. They
text=have made the ruins their stronghold.
text=
text=Go down into the ruins and break their hold.

[mission 4]
title=Find the widow's keepsake ruby.
text=A woman of Cold Svalt Town lost the man she was
text=to marry in a raid. A beast of ice that roams
text=north-west of town took the ruby he carried.
text=
text=Bring the ruby back to her.

[mission 5]
title=Run the old knight's errand.
text=An old knight who lives in Cold Svalt Town is
text=waiting for something he ordered from the smith
text=in Remote Town.
text=
text=Fetch it from the smith and take it to him.
text=Not much of a job for a soldier, but it helps
text=the townsfolk.

[mission 6]
title=Clear the Cold Ruins.
text=Scouts report that the monsters near Cold Svalt
text=Town come from the Cold Ruins, north-west of
text=the town.
text=
text=Go to the Cold Ruins and clear them out.

[mission 7]
title=Search the Purgatory of Judgments.
text=A scouting party sent to the Purgatory of
text=Judgments, south-east of Cold Svalt Town, has
text=stopped reporting.
text=
text=Something is wrong there.
text=
text=Search the place and destroy any monsters
text=you find.

[mission 8]
title=Search the Remains of Reincarnation.
text=Monsters may be gathering in the Remains of
text=Reincarnation, south-west of Cold Svalt Town.
text=
text=Search the remains and destroy any monsters
text=you find.

[mission 9]
title=Explore the land beyond the Remains.
text=A road leads on from the far end of the Remains
text=of Reincarnation. Where it goes may be where
text=the monsters come from.
text=
text=Follow it and see what lies beyond.

[mission 10]
title=Search the Immortal Remains.
text=The monsters troubling Cold Svalt Town most
text=likely make their home in the Immortal Remains,
text=beyond the Remains of Reincarnation.
text=
text=Search the Immortal Remains and destroy any
text=monsters you find.

# The second area.

[mission 11]
title=Break the thieves south-east of Kanfore.
text=A band of thieves camped south-east of the
text=coal mine has its eye on the town's stores.
text=
text=Track the band down south-east of Kanfore
text=and break it.

[mission 12]
title=Explore the Mining Tunnel of Yugunos.
text=Find out what lies in the Mining Tunnel of
text=Yugunos.
text=
text=The tunnel opens off Dragon Road, a long
text=way west of Fanann.

[mission 13]
title=Find the wizard Orsolan.
text=The elves won't let us into their village
text=unless someone they trust speaks for us.
text=Orsolan the wizard knows the seal works
text=well; ask him to talk to them.
text=
text=His tower stands deep in the Forest of
text=Spirits, east of Cross Agora.

[mission 14]
title=Recover the seal crystal.
text=Thieves made off with a crystal the seal
text=works cannot run without.
text=
text=Their fort lies in the Forest of Knight's
text=Misery, west of Cross Agora. Get the
text=crystal back from them.

[mission 15]
title=Win back the seal works' control room.
text=Demons hold the room that guards and runs
text=the seal works.
text=
text=An underground passage south of the Mining
text=Tunnel of Yugunos leads there. Take the
text=room back.

[mission 16]
title=Retake the power supply.
text=The demons seized the power supply beyond
text=the Labyrinth of Mauve, far to the south
text=of Fanann.
text=
text=Take it back from them.

[mission 17]
title=Slay the dragons.
text=The dragons at the bottom of the Mining
text=Tunnel of Yugunos are awake.
text=
text=Bring them down.

[mission 18]
title=Clear the giant spiders.
text=Giant spiders have nested in the Forest of
text=Silence.
text=
text=Wipe them out.

[mission 19]
title=Search the Marsh storehouse.
text=Find proof of the Marsh family's crooked
text=dealings in their hidden storehouse.
text=
text=It lies at the far end of the Forest of
text=Wesley, past the north-west of Butterfly
text=Hill.

[mission 34]
title=Recover the Moonwell Tear.
text=The Moonwell Tear, gem of the king of the
text=spirits, has been stolen.
text=
text=Get it back and hand it to the elder of
text=Fanann.

# The third area.

[mission 20]
title=Clear the demons near the South Camp.
text=What is left of a demon company, broken in
text=an ambush, is regrouping at the foot of
text=Mt. Tedoron, north of East Antalusia.
text=
text=Finish them off.

[mission 21]
title=Recover the Sacred Feather.
text=The Sacred Feather, a relic of Valmere the
text=White Angel, has been stolen.
text=
text=The thieves seem to have fled south-west of
text=the South Camp of Yugunos. Get it back.

[mission 22]
title=Recover the Angel's Tress.
text=No sooner was the Angel's Tress, a relic of
text=Valmere the White Angel, found than the cave
text=under Antalusia's church was overrun.
text=
text=Take the relic back.

[mission 23]
title=Carry Bishop Aurel's report.
text=Bishop Aurel of Antalusia gave me a report
text=for Lord Valdric in the Town of Losmans.
text=
text=Losmans lies west: go through West Antalusia
text=and Gungstonwald, then keep heading west.

[mission 24]
title=Explore the Remains of Heartbeat.
text=Losmans needs power to mend its castle wall.
text=Look into the Remains of Heartbeat for it.
text=
text=They lie in the Wilds of Ryumyaku, north of
text=West Antalusia, east of the Plain of Dialose.

[mission 25]
title=Take back the pipe works.
text=Demons hold the pipe works that carry power
text=to Losmans for its wall.
text=
text=Drive them out. The works stand by the Gulf
text=of Lucentia, west of the Plain of Dialose
text=through West Antalusia, south of Calado.

[mission 26]
title=Learn how the elf rangers died.
text=A picked company of elf rangers has been
text=wiped out.
text=
text=Find out what happened to them.

[mission 27]
title=Seek out Licarn, the holy knight.
text=Licarn, the holy knight in the Tower of
text=Licarn south of Losmans, may know something.
text=
text=Go and hear what he has to say.

[mission 28]
title=Win back the Tower of Licarn.
text=Something has taken the Tower of Licarn.
text=Sweep it from the top floor to the bottom
text=to take it back.

[mission 29]
title=Recover the Silver Spike.
text=The Silver Spike, a relic of Valmere the
text=White Angel, seems to lie in the Dragon Cave.
text=The dragon sleeps; take the relic quietly.
text=
text=The cave is in the Forest of Ilbarna, west
text=of South Losmans.

[mission 30]
title=Look into the Ancient Ruins.
text=Archbishop Krator seems to be digging into
text=something at the Ancient Ruins.
text=
text=Find them on the Hill of Heaven, north
text=through the Forest of Ilbarna.

[mission 31]
title=Find a cure for the poison.
text=Someone has poisoned Lord Valdric!
text=
text=Get a cure in Ponse, the dwarves' village,
text=east of the Moldona Peninsula, south across
text=South Losmans.

[mission 32]
title=Bring Archbishop Krator down.
text=Archbishop Krator was behind it all. He has
text=shut himself in the Remains of the Dead in
text=Alteria.
text=
text=Alteria is reached from Sena's Small Shrine,
text=north of the Road of Atonement on the east of
text=the Hill of Heaven. Stop him.

[mission 33]
title=Run errands for Mrs. Rowan.
text=Mrs. Rowan, a lady of Losmans, wants white
text=cloth, red thread and silver needles.
text=
text=Bring them to her when there is time.

[mission 35]
title=Find the old short sword.
text=Hargrim, the smith of Ponse, wants an old
text=short sword of the ancients.
text=
text=Bring it to him if you come across one.

[mission 36]
title=Recover the White Locket.
text=The White Locket, a relic of Valmere the
text=White Angel, seems to be in an old research
text=hall in the Wyrmwood, past the Ruins of the
text=Lake west of Calado.
text=
text=Bring it to Lord Valdric in Losmans.

[mission 37]
title=Take the relics to Saint Seren.
text=Valmere the White Angel and Saint Seren are
text=bound together somehow.
text=
text=Bring the White Angel's relics to Seren.

[mission 38]
title=Find the Blue and Green Orbs.
text=Five orbs open the way to Aurion.
text=
text=Find the Blue and Green Orbs first, near
text=Berini Village, as Valmere said.

[mission 39]
title=Find a keepsake of Krator.
text=Mrs. Krator asked me to look in a ruin for
text=something that belonged to her husband.
text=
text=I have no idea what it might be, so for now
text=I'll take whatever I find.

[mission 40]
title=Find the Red Orb.
text=Valmere has set the last trial before
text=Aurion.
text=
text=Fetch the Red Orb from the tower of Berini
text=Village.

[mission 41]
title=Win back the Ruins of Exorcism.
text=The magic in the air has grown stronger, and
text=the demons of Ento Village suffer for it.
text=
text=Take the Ruins of Exorcism. They lie on
text=Orphe Beach, north through the Demon's
text=Forest.

[mission 42]
title=Make for Goliate's Mansion.
text=Goliate serves the demons and may know
text=something about the gate of the Devil's
text=Castle.
text=
text=Find Goliate's Mansion somewhere in Aurion.

[mission 43]
title=Defeat Morvane.
text=The road to the Devil's Castle lies open.
text=
text=What comes next is up to you.

[mission 44]
title=Visit the sage in the Ruins of the Wise.
text=A wise man is said to study the ruins of
text=this world. I would very much like to meet
text=him.

[mission 45]
title=Talk Krator's bishops into yielding.
text=Bishops of the fallen Archbishop Krator's
text=party have rebelled and holed up in a tower
text=in the Golas Desert.
text=
text=Talk them round. The Warp Gate in Losmans
text=reaches the Golas Desert.

[mission 46]
title=Take the Fort of Demons.
text=A band of demons is gathering at the Fort of
text=Demons. Their strength will grow unless we
text=stop them.
text=
text=The burrow in Ento Village warps there; the
text=demons of the Forest of Poison carry the
text=fang that the warp needs.

[mission 47]
title=Go to the Forest of Madness.
text=The grimling faith is said to have set its
text=captured demons loose in a forest.
text=
text=The Warp Gate leads to the Forest of
text=Madness.
# The hero's companions, standing in for the original's Table.Tbd tables 60
# and 800-805: see docs/content.md. The kinds keep the original's numbers,
# so CHANGEPARTNER, saves and the kennel scripts work with either. Names,
# colours and stats are our own. A new hero starts with kind 0.
#
# Each stat is its value at level 1, then what each later level adds; the
# last number carries on to level 35. element and the stun_ and jump_
# lines are the value at each level instead. Speeds are as the hero's
# (walking 128); stun chances are percent, lengths ticks; the jump lands
# on a square jump_area wide; experience is the kills to the next level.

# A grey wolf-dog: steady all round.
[partner 0]
name=Ash
folder=0                 # Character/PARTNER/00000000
tint=1000,1000,1000      # red, green, blue in thousandths
attack_speed=128
walk=126,0
run=224,0
hp=320,70
